WEBVTT

00:05:58.674 --> 00:06:00.386
Now let that sink in for a second.

00:06:01.030 --> 00:06:04.877
95 percent of our oceans
remain unexplored.

00:06:05.712 --> 00:06:07.877
I think it's very safe to say

00:06:07.901 --> 00:06:12.730
that we don't even know
how much about life we do not know.

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:16.735
So, it's not surprising
that every week in my field

00:06:16.759 --> 00:06:19.970
we begin to see the addition
of more and more new species

00:06:19.994 --> 00:06:22.253
to this amazing tree of life.

00:06:22.277 --> 00:06:23.674
This one for example --

00:06:23.698 --> 00:06:25.604
discovered earlier this summer,

00:06:25.628 --> 00:06:26.841
new to science,

00:06:26.865 --> 00:06:30.157
and now occupying its lonely branch
in our family tree.